714
00:31:12.990 --> 00:31:14.333
Yeah.

715
00:31:14.334 --> 00:31:15.678
Look here.

716
00:31:15.679 --> 00:31:18.990
This is not screwed in.
this panel.

717
00:31:20.748 --> 00:31:22.437
Now. maybe Len didn't

718
